DATA NOTICE: prna

Data files tracked by DVC in this directory (fetch with `dvc pull`):
  data_tables.tar.gz -> data_tables/ (244 files)
  HIV1-NL43.tar.gz   -> HIV1-NL43.seq
  test.tar.gz        -> test.seq

What:
  RNA/DNA nearest-neighbor thermodynamic parameter tables, the HIV-1
  NL4-3 RNA sequence, and a small test sequence.

Source:
  data_tables/ comes from an older release of RNAstructure (Mathews
  Lab, University of Rochester, https://rna.urmc.rochester.edu/).
  Only the current release (6.6) is published there; 124 of our 244
  files are identical to it (checked 2026-11-19). The HIV-1 NL4-3
  sequence is public GenBank data.

